# salt-radar port of btop++'s gruvbox_dark_v2.theme
# (https://github.com/aristocratos/btop, Apache-2.0)
#
# Bashtop gruvbox (https://github.com/morhetz/gruvbox) theme
# First version created By BachoSeven
# Adjustments to proper colors by Pietryszak (https://github.com/pietryszak/)
#
# The status, pulse and highlight colors salt-radar adds come from
# the gruvbox palette.

